  description: 'Up to thrice per turn, during your Main Phase: You can send 3 other
    cards of the same type (Monster, Spell, or Trap) from your hand and/or face-up
    field to the GY, then you can Special Summon 1 "Sacred Beast" monster from your
    hand, Deck, GY, or banishment, and if you do, it is unaffected by your opponent''s
    activated Spell/Trap effects. If you control a "Sacred Beast" monster whose original
    Level is 10: You can draw 2 cards. You can only use this effect of "Fallen Paradise
    of the Sacred Beasts" once per turn.'
